---
import wordmark from "../assets/brand/haeon-wordmark.png";
import { siteConfig } from "../lib/site";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="global-footer">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <a class="footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="해온 HAEON 홈">
          <img src={wordmark.src} width="789" height="399" alt="" />
          <span>HAEON</span>
        </a>
        <p class="footer-note">듣고, 연결하고, 내 말로 이어가는 한국어. 해온은 이해 중심의 한국어 학습 경험을 만듭니다.</p>
        {siteConfig.contactEmail && (
          <p class="footer-note"><a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a></p>
        )}
      </div>
      <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="하단 메뉴">
        <a href="/events/free-pronunciation-coaching/">무료 발음 체크</a>
        <a href="/classes/">수업</a>
        <a href="/study-kits/">학습 키트</a>
        <a href="/contact/">문의</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">개인정보 처리방침</a>
        <a href="/terms/">이용약관</a>
        <a href="/refund/">환불 안내</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="global-footer-bottom">
      <span>© {year} HAEON Korean Learning</span>
      <span>{siteConfig.business.name}{siteConfig.business.representative ? ` · 대표 ${siteConfig.business.representative}` : ""}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
